# Pokemon Emerald (USA, Europe) -- Pokemon Center 2F Cable Club > TRADE
# CENTER, a one-for-one trade of party slot 0 (the Gen 3 cable trade: the
# same link layer as Ruby/Sapphire).  STAND-IN for the requested Ruby<->Ruby
# fixture: no Ruby battery on this PC reaches the Cable Club (it needs the
# Pokedex and two Pokemon), while the owner's two Emerald rig saves (the
# harness-kit golden saves, different parties, parked at Mauville PC 2F) do.
# The script is the wireless Trade Center rig's (testdata/fixtures/
# emerald_tradecenter_*.inputs) adapted to the cable: same RAM gates
# (pret/pokeemerald symbols), no wireless adapter, so the attendant opens the
# CABLE club.  Oracle: the two party-slot-0 personalities swap.
